OL,3,GNEWSAArrest made over theft of historic
OL,4,Agold trophy from museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 71-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with the theft of a historic
OL,8,Fgold trophy from Glasgow's Riverside
OL,9,FMuseum.
OL,11,FThe artefact, worth almost #500,000,
OL,12,Fwas stolen in October last year.
OL,14,FBut Police Scotland did not publicise
OL,15,Fthe robbery until April over fears the
OL,16,Ftrophy would be destroyed.
OL,18,FThe force confirmed the man was
OL,19,Farrested on Thursday and later released
OL,20,Fwithout charge.
